Cors__AllowedOrigins__0=https://neyeihtiyacvar.com
Cors__AllowedOrigins__1=https://www.neyeihtiyacvar.com

Resend__ApiKey=CHANGE_ME
Resend__FromEmail=no-reply@neyeihtiyacvar.com